    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这一期节目为大家比较详细地介绍了大部分攀登运动分类的起源、发展史及其特点。其中包括：登山、攀岩、攀冰、混合攀干攀、小众攀登，等等。为了方便大家食用，以下是时间点和对应话题：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:00:13</a>：本集介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">00:02:10</a>：登山起源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">00:06:00</a>：8000米级别山峰，各大洲最高峰首登史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">00:10:58</a>：高海拔登山的三种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">00:13:19</a>：常见地形</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">00:13:50</a>：攀岩发展史-早期辅助攀登</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">00:17:19</a>：优胜美地轶事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">00:20:46</a>：传统攀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">00:21:51</a>：运动攀诞生、运动攀标杆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">00:26:54</a>：顶绳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">00:28:49</a>：室内岩馆和岩点诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">00:33:54</a>：抱石起源、抱石标杆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">00:37:19</a>：攀岩比赛发展史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">00:41:10</a>：独攀-free solo、深水独攀、绳索独攀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3144">00:52:24</a>：攀冰、混合攀，干攀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">01:00:20</a>：小众攀登运动</span></p>]]></description>
